{
"Items.MaidSilkDress.Desc": "This flowing, pure-white dress was made from the silk of your daughter's cocoon. Its beauty and elegance give its wearer an air of unapproachable eminence, though for some reason, you can't help heat from rising to your face whenever you glance at it.\nSpecial: Dodge increases with enemy lust."
"Items.MaidSilkDress.Long": "a moth-silk dress"
"Items.MaidSilkDress.Short": "M.Silk Dress"
}
